NVIDIA PAIR icon
================

`nvpair.png` is the application icon from NVIDIA Personal AI Router
(https://github.com/NVIDIA/Personal-AI-Router), Apache-2.0.

This plugin redistributes that icon only to identify the PAIR app on the
Omarchy bar. NVIDIA PAIR itself is a separate project; this plugin does
not claim NVIDIA trademarks beyond nominative use.

The plugin code in this repository is MIT (see LICENSE).
